abstract: >-
  Path-consistency differential harness for DNS resolution stacks. Pair-mode
  Unbound and dnsmasq stand-ins are compared under pinned adversary and DNSSEC
  posture; checksummed smoke and adversarial manifests support reproducible
  laboratory measurements (not published vulnerability findings).
